## Intake rules

- Include a reproducible symptom, missing invariant, review finding, or measured cost.
- Name the affected boundary or document and the smallest useful next action.
- Set a state such as `not_started`, `active`, `blocked`, `verified`, or `passing`.
- Promote an entry into the plan or tracking record when it becomes active work; do not silently expand the current slice.
- Close an entry only after the action and its verification evidence are recorded.
